{"item_uid": "學測87-science-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 87, "year_ce": 1998, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "圖 3 是鮑氏反應系列，愈上方的礦物熔點愈高，則長石類的三種礦物從先到後的結\n晶順序如何？", "options": {"A": "鈉長石，鉀長石，鈣長石", "B": "鈉長石，鈣長石，鉀長石", "C": "鉀長石，鈉長石，鈣長石", "D": "鉀長石，鈣長石，鈉長石", "E": "鈣長石，鈉長石，鉀長石"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測87-science-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 87, "year_ce": 1998, "subject_key": "science", "subject_zh": "自然", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列有關變質岩的敘述，何者錯誤？", "options": {"A": "板岩是一種具葉理的變質岩", "B": "大理岩是石灰岩變質而成", "C": "石英岩是一種不具葉理的變質岩", "D": "受到溫度壓力影響，所有的變質岩均具有葉理", "E": "蛇紋岩由橄欖岩變質而成"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
